  "observations": [
    "Strictly monochrome: white / #1C1C1C. The only chromatic values in the system are the gold #FFD700 sale+star colour and the red #E32C2B sold-out badge.",
    "--accent is set to the same value as --text, so the theme's accent slot is effectively unused.",
    "Warmth in the visual identity comes entirely from photography (sand, amber, wood tones), not from CSS."
  ]
